The bug report describes an issue with the graticule (grid lines) not displaying correctly when the map projection crosses the dateline. The expected behavior is for all meridians and parallels within the projection extent to appear correctly. The issue arises because the `proj4` library normalizes longitudes, which can cause problems when trying to extend parallels across the dateline.

